Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: add Queens Customs admin portal at
 admin.queenscustoms.shop
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Integrates the full Queens Customs admin portal directly into myk-hub so
it deploys automatically to GoDaddy when main is updated.

Hostname routing:
  admin.queenscustoms.shop  → admin portal pages + API
  queenscustoms.shop        → static site + public API endpoints

Admin portal URLs (live after deploy):
  https://admin.queenscustoms.shop/         → login
  https://admin.queenscustoms.shop/admin/login
  https://admin.queenscustoms.shop/admin/operations
  https://admin.queenscustoms.shop/admin/setup-wizard

API endpoints:
  Public (no auth, callable from queenscustoms.shop):
    POST /api/orders      → orders dashboard
    POST /api/inquiries   → inquiries inbox
    GET  /api/products    → live product catalog

  Admin (JWT required):
    POST /api/admin/auth/login
    GET  /api/admin/auth/me
    GET|POST /api/admin/users
    PUT|DELETE /api/admin/users/:id
    GET /api/admin/orders
    PUT /api/admin/orders/:id/status
    GET /api/admin/inquiries
    PUT /api/admin/inquiries/:id
    GET|PUT /api/admin/products
    GET|PUT /api/admin/integrations

Authentication: bcryptjs (12 rounds) + JWT (HS256, 8h)
Master admin auto-seeded from ADMIN_SEED_EMAIL / ADMIN_SEED_PASSWORD env vars.

Environment variables needed in GoDaddy app settings:
  ADMIN_JWT_SECRET=<long-random-string>
  ADMIN_SEED_PASSWORD=87188718

Files added:
  admin/          — auth, db, middleware, seed, router, routes/*
  sites/queenscustoms/admin/  — login.html, operations.html, setup-wizard.html
  sites/queenscustoms/qc-integration.js  — drop-in script for the website
  .env.example    — documents required env vars
